              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                On 13 October 2026 Sole’s US site listed eight treadmills: the F50, F63, F65, F80, F83 and F85 folding models, the TT8, which was sold out, and the C80 curved manual trainer. Most were marked as new for 2026, and several differ from earlier machines sold under the same names, so check the current specification.
